<title>HONG KONG: CITIC Pacific interim net up 255 pct.</title>
<headline>CITIC Pacific interim net up 255 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   235.2 vs 69.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    16.5 vs 14.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  3,303 vs 12</p>
<p>    Net			    4,993 vs 1,405</p>
<p>    Turnover		     6,101 vs 5,365</p>
<p>    Company name		 CITIC Pacific Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  Sept 16 to 20</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   Sept 26</p>
<p>NOTE - CITIC Pacific engages in investment holding, airline operation, motor distribution and servicing, trading, warehousing and distribution, property investment and telecommunications.</p>
<p>The company proposed a special dividend of 30.0 H.K. cents vs nil.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain from disposal of a 3.85 percent interest in Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd and a 17.66 percent interest in Hong Kong Dragon Airlines Ltd.</p>
<p>Share earnings is based on a weighted average of 2.12 billion shares vs 2.01 billion.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
